0 -14 Td
(  * Regular Weekdays \(Monday through Friday\): 8:00 AM to 11:00 PM) Tj
0 -14 Td
(  * Weekends \(Saturday and Sunday\): 9:00 AM to 5:00 PM) Tj
0 -14 Td
(  * Gazetted University Holidays: 9:00 AM to 1:00 PM \(Reading Section only\)) Tj
0 -14 Td
(  * During End-Semester Examination Weeks: Overnight Reading Hall open 24 Hours continuously.) Tj
0 -14 Td
0 -10 Td
