0 -14 Td
(Borrowing privileges are mapped to university smart identification cards as follows:) Tj
0 -14 Td
(  * Undergraduate Students \(UG\): Up to 4 books simultaneously for a maximum duration of 14 days.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(  * Postgraduate Students \(PG\): Up to 6 books simultaneously for a maximum duration of 28 days.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(  * PhD / Research Scholars: Up to 10 books simultaneously for a maximum duration of 60 days.) Tj
0 -14 Td
0 -10 Td
(5.3 Overdue Fines and Damage Penalties:) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Overdue books attract a late return fine of Rs. 5 per day per book for the first 7 days.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(From day 8 onwards, the late fine escalates to Rs. 10 per day per book until returned.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Lost or damaged library books must be replaced with the latest print edition plus a 20% processing charge.) Tj
